after("""which is not in the table above.""", """the threshold rows are now under maker-checker: a row is proposed by one person and approved by another on Settings, Staging basis (`StagingThresholdService`), forward only and never into a locked month, and staging reads only approved rows. The legacy `StagingClassifier` (the Excel loan-book importer) reads the rule at the import's period end and stops with the reason when none is in force; it no longer falls back to 31 and 181 days (system audit H11; `GoLiveControlsTest`, `StagingClassifierTest`).""")

